repository: https://github.com/AI45Lab/OpenART
repository-code: https://github.com/AI45Lab/OpenART
url: https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.00677
abstract: >-
  OpenART is an executable benchmark and runtime for evaluating the safety of
  tool-using code agents in long-running, evolving environments. It executes
  target agents inside Docker environments whose persistent state can be
  mutated mid-run by an attacker (environment evolution), evaluates them
  against fixed hidden safety contracts, and ships a planner that generates
  validated long-horizon tasks (10K+ scenarios, 50 domains, 500K+ tools and
  skills, median 97 tool calls) plus a 15-agent x 5-model evaluation matrix.
keywords:
  - agent-safety
  - llm-agents
  - red-teaming
  - prompt-injection
  - benchmark
  - tool-use
  - long-horizon
  - environment-evolution
